Attribution / Inspiration

This project is an independent, clean-room re-engineering of content-creation
patterns inspired by (not derived from, not forked from) the following open
projects, each of which inspired specific design ideas:

- https://github.com/Jakeschincariol/instagram-agent-skill  (Instagram agent skill structure)
- https://github.com/sergebulaev/instagram-skills           (Instagram content skill flows)
- https://github.com/Nutlope/hallmark                       (visual formatting elements & slop linting idea)
- https://github.com/coreyhaines31/marketingskills          (SEO / copywriting skill organization)

All Persian-language adaptations, NLP engine code, regex re-engineering and
lexicons in this repository are original work written for Persian (Farsi).
